Package: bayesmaDatR
Title: Manage and Prepare Data for Bayesian Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Benjamin", "Moran", email = "benjaminlmoran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import, manage, validate, and prepare systematic review data for
    Bayesian meta-analysis. Provides an interactive Shiny workbook manager,
    outcome-specific effect-size calculations, arm-level data preparation,
    risk-of-bias fields, and INSPECT-SR data management.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://blmoran.github.io/bayesmaDatR, https://github.com/BLMoran/bayesmaDatR
BugReports: https://github.com/BLMoran/bayesmaDatR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
